{"version":1,"content":"<p>馬來西亞女神林明禎前日（28日）限時動態自爆尷尬事！</p><p>林明禎描述當天自己興高采烈地出門時，一走進電梯就不小心放了一個「悠長的微醺」，隨着電梯一路往下，經過13樓時，她才驚覺情況不妙，濃烈氣味逐漸蔓延，即閉上眼睛祈求上天幫忙：「天！</p><p>求求您讓這台</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:54.958895+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:35:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.579907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.579907+00:00","content_hash":"72c6d526c7698b6a0cd074ca15149017e74250a26ef332817af73538c27cba93","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}